-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה — the vocabulary its sections share.
-- Only what more than one section uses lives here; a section's own terms
-- live in its own file, beside the clause that coins them.

§ `תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה — אוצר מילים משותף`

@desc The parties the takanon gives rights to or puts duties on.
DECLARE Party IS ONE OF
    `the teaching employee`
    `the employer`
    `the Ministry of Education`
    `the Treasury`
    `the conditions-of-service department`
    `the teachers' union`
    `the district medical committee`

@desc A school year runs from 1 September; months are counted from it, so 1 is September and 10 is June.
DECLARE `school month` IS ONE OF
    September, October, November, December, January, February,
    March, April, May, June, July, August

GIVEN m IS A `school month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `month number` m IS
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN September THEN 1
    WHEN October   THEN 2
    WHEN November  THEN 3
    WHEN December  THEN 4
    WHEN January   THEN 5
    WHEN February  THEN 6
    WHEN March     THEN 7
    WHEN April     THEN 8
    WHEN May       THEN 9
    WHEN June      THEN 10
    WHEN July      THEN 11
    WHEN August    THEN 12

@desc The share of a full position the employee holds in the year (1 = one full position).
DECLARE `position` HAS
    `fraction` IS A NUMBER
